    "note": "phoneDSH-owned record:// vectors; there is no dsh-bot upstream file."
  },
  "upstream": [],
  "delta": [
    "Freeze the two phoneDSH record reference shapes: record://session/<sessionId>#<seq> for one DSH session-log line and record://event/<commitSeq> for one bot_events row.",
    "Parser normalization is limited to surrounding ASCII whitespace, ASCII case-insensitive scheme/authority and leading zeros in the decimal position; every other non-canonical spelling is invalid.",
    "The decimal position is bounded by 2^53-1 and event commitSeq starts at 1."
  ],
